# One2X Skill Sync

When updating any project One2X skill under `.cursor/skills/one2x-*`, also check and update the matching local Codex skill under `~/.codex/skills/one2x-*`.

Keep intentional path differences intact:

- Project Cursor skills may reference workspace files such as `../../../design.md`.
- Codex skills may reference shared resources such as `../one2x-design-resources/design.md`.

After editing, verify the important guidance exists in both copies.
